{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","彗星怒矢"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","혜성 화살"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","射出彗星箭矢，对路径上的敌人造成伤害，在区域内的其他友军普通攻击会召唤流星造成一次额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","혜성 화살을 발사해 경로상의 적에게 대미지를 입히고, 구역 내 다른 아군이 일반 공격 시 유성을 소환하여 추가 대미지를 1회 입힌다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向射出一支彗星箭矢，对箭矢沿途5格宽度内的所有敌人造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，并留下一片“群星投影”，持续7秒，在“群星投影”内的其他友军使用普通攻击时，会同时召唤流星攻击目标，对其造成该友军50%攻击力的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","한 방향을 선택하여 혜성 화살을 발사하여 화살 경로 5칸 너비 내의 모든 적에게 200% + 20% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 별들의 그림자를 남기며 7초간 지속된다. 별들의 그림자 내의 다른 아군이 일반 공격을 사용할 때 유성을 소환해 목표를 공격하여 해당 아군 공격력 50%의 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":49,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":45,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 220% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 240% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 260% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 270% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","星辰祝福"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","별의 축복"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","呼唤星辰提升全队攻击速度，首次释放额外回复能量。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","별을 소환하여 파티의 공격 속도를 증가시키고, 첫 시전 시 추가로 에너지를 회복한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","星辰降下祝福，为所有友军提升25 + 5点攻击速度，持续6秒。战斗开始时会立即使用一次，额外使每名友军回复120点能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","별이 축복을 내려 모든 아군의 공격 속도가 6초간 25 + 5 증가한다. 전투 시작 시 즉시 1회 시전하며, 추가로 모든 아군의 에너지를 120 회복시킨다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","攻击速度提升幅度增加至30 + 5点。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","공격 속도 증가폭이 30 + 5(으)로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":13,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","持续时间提升至8秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","지속 시간이 8초로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","攻击速度提升幅度增加至40 + 5点。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","공격 속도 증가폭이 40 + 5(으)로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":13,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","新星冲击"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","노바 스트라이크"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对全体敌人召唤流星攻击，降低其护甲。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","유성을 소환하여 전체 적을 공격하고 물리 방어력을 감소시킨다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","召唤流星，对全体敌人造成100% ATK伤害，在5 + 1.5秒内降低其-10%护甲。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","유성을 소환하여 전체 적에게 100% ATK의 대미지를 입히며, 5 + 1.5초 동안 물리 방어력을 -10% 감소시킨다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至120% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 120% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护甲降低幅度提升至-12%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","물리 방어력 감소폭이 -12%로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至130% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 130% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 공격 속도가 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격 속도가 21 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升27点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격 속도가 27 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升33点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격 속도가 33 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","毁灭流星"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","파괴의 유성"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤流星协助自己攻击。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","유성을 소환하여 함께 공격한다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，召唤流星围绕自身，每当自身普通攻击时，流星也会攻击目标，造成40% ATK的物理伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 시작 시 유성을 소환하여 자신을 감싼다. 일반 공격을 할 때마다 유성도 함께 목표를 공격하여 40% ATK의 물리 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":55,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至50% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当场上敌人存在护盾时，流星会发射一枚陨石攻击该目标，造成350% ATK的伤害，若成功破坏护盾，则眩晕目标4秒。流星每10秒至多发射一枚陨石。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전장에 있는 적이 실드 보유 시, 유성은 운석을 발사해 목표를 공격하여 목표에게 350% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 만약 실드 파괴에 성공하면 목표를 4초간 스턴시킨다. 유성은 10초마다 운석을 최대 1회 발사한다."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":45,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成450% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","450% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":2,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":0,"end":8,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“彗星怒矢”命中的敌人额外降低护甲。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","스킬 혜성 화살에 명중된 적은 물리 방어력이 추가로 감소한다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“彗星怒矢”命中的敌人在6秒内降低25%护甲。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","스킬 혜성 화살에 명중된 적은 6초 동안 물리 방어력이 25% 감소한다."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","额外获得300点初始能量。技能“彗星怒矢”留下的“群星投影”时间延长7秒，并且友军攻击召唤的流星会附带莱卡40% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","추가로 초기 에너지를 300 획득한다. 스킬 혜성 화살의 남은 별들의 그림자 시간이 7초 연장되고, 아군의 공격으로 소환한 유성이 라이카 40% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":77,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","星辰之弦"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","별의 활시위"]]}